    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"All faiths and backgrounds · Six languages\",\"title\":\"Religious and cultural circumcision\",\"lede\":\"Religious and cultural circumcision is a large part of our work. We welcome families and adult patients from all faiths and backgrounds and aim to provide a respectful clinical service that understands the importance of the decision.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Religious and cultural\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our Muslim practitioners can carry out circumcision in accordance with the Sunnah. The same clinical standards apply whatever the reason for circumcision: assessment first, an age-appropriate method, local anaesthetic, written aftercare and access to follow-up support.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We also understand that it is customary to do male circumcision is some cultures such as Africa, Philippines, Fiji and other parts of the world.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We see patients from London, elsewhere in the UK and from abroad. If you are travelling a long distance, contact us before booking so we can discuss timing, documentation and follow-up arrangements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"Practical detail\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Sunnah practice\",\"v\":\"Yes, by our Muslim practitioners\"},{\"k\":\"All faiths\",\"v\":\"Families and adult patients welcome\"},{\"k\":\"Anaesthetic\",\"v\":\"Local anaesthetic\"},{\"k\":\"Aftercare\",\"v\":\"Written aftercare and follow-up support\"},{\"k\":\"Languages\",\"v\":\"English, Arabic, Urdu, Hindi, Punjabi and Turkish\"},{\"k\":\"Setting\",\"v\":\"CQC registered clinic\"}],\"note\":\"\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Ask about a date\",\"text\":\"If you are travelling a long distance, contact us before booking so we can discuss timing, documentation and follow-up arrangements.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"By age\",\"heading\":\"The procedure itself, by age group\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"exclude\":\"\",\"banded\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
